Agent 在 `⏸ CP-xx` 处输出 **决策包**：①目的 ②判断要点 ③自检 ④推荐 ⑤编号选项。

| 文档 | 用途 |
|------|------|
| [docs/qa/ai-sdlc-agent-active-guidance.md](docs/qa/ai-sdlc-agent-active-guidance.md) | 决策包模板 |
| [docs/qa/ai-sdlc-human-checkpoints.md](docs/qa/ai-sdlc-human-checkpoints.md) | CP 何时停 |
| [docs/qa/ai-sdlc-decision-rubrics.md](docs/qa/ai-sdlc-decision-rubrics.md) | 通用 Allow/Stop 判据 |
| [docs/qa/ai-sdlc-code-review.md](docs/qa/ai-sdlc-code-review.md) | 每次 commit 前 Review |

